= Mieczysław Niedziałkowski

Niedziałkowski represents Centrum PPS and concentrates on constitutional democracy and democratic alliances.

- @build_centrolew
- @defend_democracy
- @root: Return to main

@build_centrolew
title: Build Centrolew
subtitle: Relations with PSL Piast, PSL Wyzwolenie, NPR and PSChD improve (+3). No alliance or majority by itself.
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.advisorActionStatus(Q, 'niedzialkowski', 'build_centrolew').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_advact_build_centrolew_why +]
call: polish_advisor_commit
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.advisorAction(Q, 'niedzialkowski', 'build_centrolew');
!}

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.

@defend_democracy
title: Defend Constitutional Democracy
subtitle: The organisations of PPS stand closer to the legal institutions (+5), and attachment to democracy grows at the next monthly settlement (+5). For six months supporting an openly authoritarian project raises Centrum dissent (+5).
choose-if: {! return PolishParty.advisorActionStatus(Q, 'niedzialkowski', 'defend_democracy').available !}
unavailable-subtitle: [+ pl_advact_defend_democracy_why +]
call: polish_advisor_commit
on-arrival: {!
PolishParty.advisorAction(Q, 'niedzialkowski', 'defend_democracy');
!}

[+ pl_party_result +]

- @root: Continue.
